# OS Metadata
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Customer personal data — ignored by default (CR-006); ADR-006 exceptions below.
#
# These spreadsheets carry a named legal entity's contact list, quotation report
# and per-customer purchase history. They were tracked and pushed to a public
# remote until 2026-08-30; the repository is private now and the files have been
# untracked with `git rm --cached`, which is what this rule keeps from undoing.
#
# The rule alone would not have helped: **.gitignore has no effect on a file
# that is already tracked.** Adding it after the first commit changes nothing —
# the file keeps being staged, committed and pushed while the rule sits here
# looking like it works, and `git status` stays silent because a tracked file
# with no local edits is neither untracked nor modified. Untracking is what
# removed them; this only stops them coming back.
#
# The files remain on disk. The store of record for customer data is zuri-ai's
# CRM domain, behind its scope chain and PDPA consent controls (FR-103/SEC-005),
# not this repository. Anything under 01_raw is an intake artifact, not a store.
data-pipeline/01_raw/05_crm_customer_data/*

# The same three documents also live under lanes named after their SOURCE rather
# than their contents, which is how the first pass missed them: the fix was
# scoped to the folder whose name announced what was inside it, and identical
# copies sat in `01_flowaccount_exports/` and `archive/`. Match on the document
# kind, not the directory.
#
# `_product.xlsx` is deliberately NOT ignored — it is the price authority named
# in AGENTS.md invariant #2 and carries no personal data.
**/*_contact.xlsx
**/*_QuotationReport_.xlsx
**/*_BillingNoteReport_.xlsx
# Ignore large raw cost Excel files
data-pipeline/01_raw/08_factory_costs/*.xlsx
# Ignore archived raw cost Excel files
data-pipeline/01_raw/archive/factory_costs/*.xlsx

# ADR-006: approved 2026-08-30, private Freshair129/TN001B01-SmartGift only.
# Frozen 13-file allowlist. Future files remain ignored; public/vault exclusions stay.
!/data-pipeline/01_raw/01_flowaccount_exports/บริษัท เทราบิส จำกัด_BillingNoteReport_.xlsx
!/data-pipeline/01_raw/01_flowaccount_exports/บริษัท เทราบิส จำกัด_contact.xlsx
!/data-pipeline/01_raw/01_flowaccount_exports/บริษัท เทราบิส จำกัด_QuotationReport_.xlsx
